    "detailed_description": "Suspicious things happening in the library<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\nYou fall asleep while studying in the library.<br />\r\nI'm trapped in the library on the eighth floor. <br />\r\nI need to escape. <br />\r\nYou can take a test the next day<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\nThe game is very simple<br />\r\nIf there's an abnormality, you can get on the elevator behind you<br />\r\nIf there is no abnormality, you can board the elevator in front of you<br />\r\nBut I'm not sure if the anomaly is going to work<br />\r\nI wish you all the best<br />\r\n*******",
    "about_the_game": "Suspicious things happening in the library<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\nYou fall asleep while studying in the library.<br />\r\nI'm trapped in the library on the eighth floor. <br />\r\nI need to escape. <br />\r\nYou can take a test the next day<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*******<br />\r\nThe game is very simple<br />\r\nIf there's an abnormality, you can get on the elevator behind you<br />\r\nIf there is no abnormality, you can board the elevator in front of you<br />\r\nBut I'm not sure if the anomaly is going to work<br />\r\nI wish you all the best<br />\r\n*******",
    "short_description": "It's a very simple game where you can escape from the library on the 8th floor!",
